      "level": 2,
      "markdown": "MCX Military Clothing Sales is a uniform support service designed for service members. We help you maintain professional appearance and readiness by providing regulation‑approved uniform items, accessories, and essential services. Patrons can stay sharp, confident, and fully equipped for duty, inspections, and formal military events.\n\n(This description is shown for each of the five locations: Camp Geiger, Camp Johnson, Camp Lejeune, Courthouse Bay, and New River.)"
